WEBVTT

00:01.790 --> 00:06.530
<i>There once was a powerless prince who 
saved a kingdom with his tiny courage.</i>

00:07.660 --> 00:10.110
<i>The courage to face challenges...</i>

00:10.110 --> 00:12.060
<i>The courage to never give up...</i>

00:12.470 --> 00:14.650
<i>The courage to trust others...</i>

00:15.500 --> 00:20.180
<i>A treasure chest of untold courage 
is now about to be opened.</i>

00:27.130 --> 00:33.550
<b>Ranking of Kings</b>

00:27.130 --> 00:33.550
<b>— The Treasure Chest of Courage —</b>

00:36.500 --> 00:41.260
<i>The callous absurdity I've 
carried with me since birth</i>

00:41.260 --> 00:46.930
<i>meant playing shadow tag to find my next meal</i>

00:47.480 --> 00:50.690
<i>Bit by bit, my heart got bent out of shape</i>

00:50.690 --> 00:53.710
<i>until I tuned out both 
the cheers and the jeers</i>

00:55.910 --> 01:00.580
<i>That's how I survived my initial loneliness</i>

01:00.580 --> 01:05.590
<i>Night falls and the darkness grows</i>

01:06.000 --> 01:10.810
<i>blending in, coalescing</i>

01:11.120 --> 01:15.570
<i>around so trivial a fate as my own</i>

01:15.570 --> 01:18.380
<i>Hey, I want to get through to you</i>

01:18.380 --> 01:22.420
<i>though I may only know commonplace words</i>

01:23.930 --> 01:26.740
<i>It's so frustrating having to be like this</i>

01:26.740 --> 01:29.670
<i>Hey, never mind that it may not be easy</i>

01:29.670 --> 01:34.080
<i>to become angry or let yourself cry</i>

01:35.190 --> 01:38.770
<i>because someone could be listening in</i>

01:38.770 --> 01:41.990
<i>The only thing that's 
certain is the temperature</i>

01:44.250 --> 01:49.170
<i>whether or not we can speak heart to heart</i>

01:50.880 --> 01:53.840
<b>The Snake Charmer with the Crooked Smile</b>

02:02.480 --> 02:06.300
I realize that you are 
indebted to Prince Bojji,

02:06.540 --> 02:10.080
but I think that Prince Daida 
is more fit to be the king.

02:10.540 --> 02:13.140
The training you've been 
giving Prince Bojji...

02:13.140 --> 02:18.330
and teaching him how to read the 
movement of lips is a bit irksome.

02:19.070 --> 02:23.710
It is true, Prince Bojji may 
not measure up to be a king.

02:24.190 --> 02:25.040
Nonetheless,

02:25.510 --> 02:30.590
once he grows up, I'm sure he 
will go on to save many people.

02:30.590 --> 02:34.580
And Prince Daida will be no exception.

02:58.790 --> 03:01.260
<i>A younger Bebin had been selected 
for an elite fighting unit</i>

03:01.260 --> 03:03.610
<i>under the direct control of King Bosse.</i>

03:03.610 --> 03:06.880
<i>However, there was an unmistakable difference</i>

03:06.880 --> 03:09.320
<i>between his skills and that 
of the other elites.</i>

03:12.090 --> 03:14.840
Master Bebin, what are you doing?

03:15.690 --> 03:17.800
If you overdo it, you will
 reopen your wounds.

03:18.040 --> 03:20.410
I have no time to rest.

03:20.410 --> 03:24.340
There isn't a second to lose if I'm 
going to catch up to the others.

03:40.290 --> 03:41.400
<i>I've got this!</i>

03:54.140 --> 03:57.120
What have I been doing all this time?

03:57.530 --> 03:58.590
Damn...

04:16.070 --> 04:17.310
Master Bebin,

04:17.840 --> 04:21.220
I'm told that there is a brilliant 
master swordsman in the underworld.

04:21.220 --> 04:25.370
He is Prince Despa, 
younger brother of King Desha.

04:25.370 --> 04:27.440
The brother of the king of the underworld?

04:27.440 --> 04:30.340
However, to receive instruction from him,

04:30.340 --> 04:33.030
it is said that you will need 
a great deal of money.

04:45.680 --> 04:48.010
Halt. Yours is an unfamiliar face.

04:48.400 --> 04:50.530
What business do you have in the underworld?

04:50.530 --> 04:55.650
My name is Bebin. I have come to have 
Prince Despa teach me swordsmanship.

04:56.710 --> 04:58.160
Show me your letter of recommendation.

04:58.160 --> 04:59.830
I don't have one.

04:59.830 --> 05:02.340
We can't allow some stranger 
we know nothing about

05:02.340 --> 05:04.360
to go see Prince Despa!

05:04.710 --> 05:06.920
I assure you, there is nothing 
questionable about me.

05:06.920 --> 05:11.690
I have no one else to turn to now 
other than Prince Despa. Please!

05:11.690 --> 05:14.170
I said no, and I meant it! Leave!

05:16.050 --> 05:21.440
I want to get stronger! I have 
to get stronger! I beg you!

05:22.450 --> 05:23.740
Let him pass.

05:24.460 --> 05:25.790
Captain!

05:26.930 --> 05:29.810
I heard what you said. Come with me.

05:29.810 --> 05:30.840
But sir...

05:31.520 --> 05:33.250
I'll take responsibility for him.

05:36.170 --> 05:37.520
Prince Despa!

05:39.080 --> 05:40.740
Maybe he's not home.

05:46.250 --> 05:50.250
What do you need? I'm busy taking 
care of my skin right now.

05:50.250 --> 05:52.080
I-I beg your pardon.

05:52.080 --> 05:55.610
This man says that he wants you 
to train him in swordsmanship.

05:56.050 --> 05:57.620
P-Please, sir.

06:06.600 --> 06:07.350
Oh, right...

06:14.390 --> 06:16.220
Well, all right.

06:16.540 --> 06:20.790
Why don't we start by letting 
me see what you're capable of?

06:27.400 --> 06:28.770
Okay, begin!

06:29.230 --> 06:30.040
Bring it!

06:41.990 --> 06:45.590
Indeed, he seems to have 
the fundamentals down.

06:53.590 --> 06:54.810
That's enough!

06:55.170 --> 06:57.190
Captain, over here.

06:58.690 --> 06:59.780
What do you think?

07:00.240 --> 07:02.270
He has both technique and stamina.

07:02.270 --> 07:04.640
There are signs that he has had 
sufficient training, as well.

07:05.240 --> 07:08.330
Still, I doubt that we will 
see any further improvement.

07:08.610 --> 07:11.080
Hmm, so it would seem.

07:13.910 --> 07:18.710
Bebin, to be honest with you, 
the money you have paid is insufficient.

07:18.710 --> 07:21.470
You can owe me until you make it big.

07:21.470 --> 07:21.960
Huh?

07:21.960 --> 07:23.920
P-Prince Despa?

07:24.140 --> 07:26.750
I can see his flaw.

07:26.750 --> 07:31.170
Once he overcomes it, he is sure 
to break out of his shell.

07:32.100 --> 07:34.870
And then I'm certain he'll be successful,

07:34.870 --> 07:36.970
so I'll be raking in payments from him!

07:39.310 --> 07:42.150
Now, let's be off, Bebin.

07:47.510 --> 07:50.150
Everyone just needs the right opportunity.

07:50.530 --> 07:54.110
Oh, also, you have this air 
of tragic heroism about you.

07:54.410 --> 07:57.560
We can't have that. As they say, 
fortune comes in by a merry gate.

07:57.560 --> 08:02.120
You can change things by wearing 
a smile, even if you have to force it.

08:02.120 --> 08:03.840
Even if I have to force it?

08:05.910 --> 08:08.380
Don't you have a more 
spontaneous smile than that?

08:11.270 --> 08:14.120
Oh dear. Let me show you what I mean.

08:16.290 --> 08:19.750
Now, I think you will find my 
smile hard to top, but go ahead.

08:21.710 --> 08:25.250
Ugh... Well, that will have to do.

08:34.330 --> 08:37.050
Mm-hmm, this is the one for you.

08:38.600 --> 08:39.730
What is this?

08:40.680 --> 08:44.190
A serpentine sword. What do you 
think? Pretty nifty, right?

08:44.190 --> 08:49.010
S-Sure. But how am I supposed to 
fight with a wavy sword like this?

08:49.010 --> 08:53.470
Whoever said that one could only 
fight with a straight sword?

08:53.700 --> 08:54.920
Well...

08:54.920 --> 08:57.260
Listen to me. The shortcoming you have

08:57.260 --> 08:59.930
is that your view is too narrow 
because you are so serious.

09:00.500 --> 09:02.220
You are both earnest and hardworking.

09:02.220 --> 09:04.840
But you lack the power it 
takes to break through.

09:04.840 --> 09:08.780
So you become desperate, 
and that limits your scope.

09:08.780 --> 09:12.530
In other words, once you gain 
the strength to break through,

09:12.530 --> 09:16.560
it will naturally give you the leeway 
to broaden your perspective.

09:17.470 --> 09:21.320
Now then, let's start by training 
you to cut through iron.

09:21.320 --> 09:23.840
Cut through iron? Is that possible?

09:24.160 --> 09:27.290
Don't worry. Knowing you, you can do it.

09:27.290 --> 09:31.750
Here, take my hands. I will show 
you what I envision for you.

09:36.740 --> 09:39.980
It's a mental image of your development.

09:44.750 --> 09:46.340
This power...

09:47.200 --> 09:49.810
will make you stronger.

09:53.280 --> 09:57.290
It looks like you got it. Now, 
let's start your training.

09:57.290 --> 10:01.110
Oh, and by the way, that serpentine 
sword is sold separately.

10:10.490 --> 10:12.630
If you picture a world a step above you,

10:12.630 --> 10:15.840
then all your difficulties 
up to now will seem easy.

10:15.840 --> 10:19.520
That is the trigger that will let 
you break out of your shell.

10:43.040 --> 10:45.150
Congratulations, Bebin.

10:45.660 --> 10:48.340
It looks as though he's 
completely mastered it.

10:51.230 --> 10:55.980
You've done very well. Now, go back to 
your own land with your head held high.

10:59.490 --> 11:02.320
You know, he may have perfected his craft,

11:02.320 --> 11:04.540
but his smile is as questionable as ever.

11:08.200 --> 11:08.960
Begin!

11:13.310 --> 11:16.890
<i>He's stronger. But it's still not enough...</i>

11:29.400 --> 11:30.650
That's the match!

11:34.240 --> 11:35.470
Well done.

11:52.820 --> 11:55.640
You said you wanted to help Prince Bojji?

11:55.640 --> 11:57.540
That's what I said, isn't it?!

11:57.540 --> 12:01.240
Then show me the proof of your intent.

12:20.920 --> 12:21.010
<b>Ranking of Kings</b>

12:21.010 --> 12:21.090
<b>Ranking of Kings</b>

12:21.090 --> 12:21.210
<b>Ranking of Kings</b>

12:21.210 --> 12:25.890
<b>Ranking of Kings</b>

12:25.890 --> 12:30.600
<b>The Big Four's Banquet</b>

12:27.390 --> 12:30.610
<i>Following in his brother Bojji's 
footsteps, Daida becomes the king.</i>

12:31.270 --> 12:35.740
<i>And so, the Big Four do 
everything in their power</i>

12:35.740 --> 12:38.420
<i>to help the nation as it 
takes a new step forward.</i>

12:39.170 --> 12:41.760
I would like to leave the onsite 
handling of the castle's renovation

12:41.760 --> 12:44.020
in the hands of the Big Four.

12:45.350 --> 12:48.630
<i>I may not have been able 
to serve King Bojji,</i>

12:48.630 --> 12:52.370
<i>but the time for me to serve 
the country is right now!</i>

12:52.700 --> 12:55.700
In that case, I believe that 
I can do the job alone.

12:55.700 --> 12:59.030
Wha—?! No, please leave it to me.

12:59.030 --> 13:01.160
I promise you, I will see 
things through successfully.

13:01.160 --> 13:04.010
No, please order me, Dorshe, to do this.

13:04.010 --> 13:06.410
Physical labor is my specialty!

13:06.410 --> 13:09.340
Physical strength doesn't 
matter when giving direction.

13:10.850 --> 13:15.030
This is unbecoming. I believe the 
task is too much for the others.

13:15.030 --> 13:17.410
Please, see fit to allow me,
 Apeas, to do the job.

13:18.750 --> 13:21.110
In what way is it too much for us?

13:21.110 --> 13:23.060
Answer carefully, or I'll...

13:23.300 --> 13:26.430
Stop it! Why are you always like this?

13:26.900 --> 13:28.520
Enough. Leave me.

13:33.500 --> 13:34.380
Hokuro...

13:34.380 --> 13:35.200
Y-Yes, sire?

13:35.420 --> 13:36.680
I need a word.

13:36.880 --> 13:37.770
Huh?

13:44.610 --> 13:46.580
What's the meaning of this, Hokuro?

13:46.580 --> 13:48.780
You didn't tell me they would be here.

13:48.780 --> 13:52.040
Now, now, let's all drink together here.

13:52.040 --> 13:53.600
What are you plotting?

13:53.600 --> 13:54.900
I'm not plotting anything.

13:55.120 --> 13:56.560
Something's fishy.

13:56.860 --> 14:01.150
C-Come on, everyone! Let's drink up!

14:01.150 --> 14:02.530
Cheers!

14:12.540 --> 14:16.050
I fear for the future if the Big Four
 are getting along like this.

14:16.630 --> 14:21.010
Is there some way for us to get 
them to cooperate with each other?

14:21.670 --> 14:23.200
I don't know...

14:23.830 --> 14:28.170
You've been deeply involved with the 
Big Four during all the earlier battles.

14:28.780 --> 14:31.130
You're the only one fit to take this on.

14:32.300 --> 14:35.610
They all have a great deal of pride,

14:36.110 --> 14:39.680
but they did all come 
together to fight Ouken.

14:40.900 --> 14:44.350
<i>And now here I am, 
setting them up with drinks...</i>

14:44.660 --> 14:48.320
<i>but Domas isn't interested in 
anything but sword fighting.</i>

14:48.920 --> 14:50.030
<i>As for Apeas,</i>

14:50.420 --> 14:54.440
<i>I've heard that he does 
all of the dirty work.</i>

14:55.050 --> 14:58.020
<i>Bebin is well-informed 
and hears everything.</i>

14:58.330 --> 15:03.240
<i>I'm sure he's not a bad man, but who 
knows what he's thinking? What's more...</i>

15:03.240 --> 15:05.710
<i>He really has it in for Apeas.</i>

15:07.020 --> 15:10.760
<i>Then there's Dorshe, the most 
powerful of the Big Four.</i>

15:10.760 --> 15:14.330
<i>He's so intimidating, as if his 
face wasn't scary enough already!</i>

15:16.250 --> 15:20.440
<i>No! No! King Daida asked me to do this! 
I have to bring them all together!</i>

15:20.710 --> 15:21.400
I'm leaving.

15:21.400 --> 15:25.620
J-Just a minute, please! We've just 
barely started drinking, haven't we?

15:25.620 --> 15:28.270
Staying here is a waste of time.

15:28.270 --> 15:29.740
I'm leaving, too.

15:29.740 --> 15:30.950
Huh?!

15:31.360 --> 15:32.070
Hmph!

15:32.070 --> 15:35.130
Domas, I'm begging you, 
stay a little longer—

15:35.130 --> 15:35.900
Let me go!

15:38.610 --> 15:40.690
Ow...

15:40.690 --> 15:41.580
Keep it down!

15:42.030 --> 15:44.050
Knock off all that noise!

15:44.050 --> 15:45.650
I-I'm sorry!

15:45.650 --> 15:46.350
Hmm?

15:46.710 --> 15:51.550
Who could it be but the Big Four? 
You guys are all so feeble.

15:53.140 --> 15:54.210
What did you say?

15:54.210 --> 15:57.910
They let a man as delicate as 
you be one of the Big Four?

15:57.910 --> 16:00.450
I'd be happy to take your place.

16:06.860 --> 16:09.340
No fighting! Absolutely not!

16:09.340 --> 16:10.080
Move it!

16:10.300 --> 16:15.150
No fighting! Oh, but how 
about arm wrestling?

16:15.150 --> 16:18.170
Ridiculous! You expect me 
to play that child's game?!

16:18.170 --> 16:20.870
Ha! You're just afraid you'll lose.

16:20.870 --> 16:23.240
Why don't you head on 
home and go beddy-bye?

16:28.010 --> 16:30.710
Come on! I'll settle this in no time flat!

16:30.710 --> 16:35.120
I'm willing to take you on, 
but what will you do if you lose?

16:35.120 --> 16:36.870
I'll give you 100 gold coins!

16:36.870 --> 16:40.710
And when you lose, you'll get down 
on your knees and apologize!

16:42.490 --> 16:43.760
Sounds good to me.

16:44.120 --> 16:45.980
Just let him do as he pleases.

16:45.980 --> 16:48.720
It's a waste of time to even 
acknowledge him.

16:52.150 --> 16:53.330
Ready...

16:54.160 --> 16:55.080
Begin!

17:00.210 --> 17:02.960
The Big Four are nothing special!

17:02.960 --> 17:05.710
Now, hand over those 100 coins.

17:06.190 --> 17:10.200
I don't have it on me right now. 
You'll have to wait until tomorrow.

17:10.200 --> 17:12.910
Ha-ha, what a pathetic man.

17:12.910 --> 17:16.650
Okay, drinks are on me! Drink up, everybody!

17:19.060 --> 17:20.920
I've got next.

17:21.320 --> 17:24.380
If I beat you, it's another 100 coins.

17:27.240 --> 17:28.570
Ready...

17:28.570 --> 17:29.270
Begin!

17:31.570 --> 17:34.690
What's the matter? Is that all you got?

17:34.690 --> 17:36.750
What the hell are you doing?!

17:36.750 --> 17:37.690
Bebin!

17:47.290 --> 17:48.000
Move!

17:49.540 --> 17:51.210
Now you'll face me.

17:51.590 --> 17:52.910
Ready...

17:52.910 --> 17:53.880
Begin!

17:56.330 --> 17:57.560
Dorshe, beat him!

18:01.290 --> 18:02.760
Go, Dorshe!

18:13.830 --> 18:16.680
Hey, as long as we're at 
it, do you wanna try, too?

18:18.000 --> 18:21.160
How about we play for the 
300 coins they owe you?

18:23.890 --> 18:26.220
You're a complete idiot!

18:28.750 --> 18:31.670
Wait just a minute. Gotta take a leak.

18:34.890 --> 18:37.830
Leave it to an arm-wrestling 
champion, all right!

18:37.830 --> 18:41.710
Yeah, well, I won't be beaten 
by amateurs who are all muscle.

18:41.710 --> 18:44.480
Please take a dive on the 
last one, like we agreed.

18:45.100 --> 18:46.440
No way!

18:46.440 --> 18:47.300
Huh?!

18:47.590 --> 18:50.330
If I win this one, I'll get 600 gold coins.

18:50.330 --> 18:53.110
You're only paying me ten, right?

18:53.440 --> 18:57.730
The last one looks like the weakest 
of the lot, too. Easy money.

18:59.250 --> 19:01.300
Oh, no...

19:03.100 --> 19:05.540
I'm gonna beat you in the blink of an eye.

19:07.910 --> 19:08.740
Hey...

19:09.200 --> 19:10.450
Ready...

19:11.790 --> 19:12.810
Begin!

19:14.960 --> 19:16.120
What?!

19:16.120 --> 19:16.760
How?

19:17.240 --> 19:19.770
Looks like our advice was on the mark.

19:19.770 --> 19:21.080
Advice?

19:21.080 --> 19:22.150
Yeah.

19:23.270 --> 19:24.540
A word in your ear...

19:24.940 --> 19:27.480
I noticed something while wrestling him.

19:27.480 --> 19:30.720
The smaller this angle is here, 
the greater your advantage.

19:31.020 --> 19:35.020
Now that you mention it, he rolled 
my wrist over when I wrestled him.

19:35.340 --> 19:39.940
It felt like I was being pulled 
toward him, rather than sideways.

19:41.320 --> 19:43.370
<i>That's what's happening?</i>

19:49.010 --> 19:50.690
Once you know the trick to it...

19:51.110 --> 19:52.720
...those of us in the Big Four...

19:53.220 --> 19:55.240
...cannot be...

19:56.540 --> 19:57.300
...beaten!

20:07.140 --> 20:11.270
Have you settled on the assignment 
for the castle renovation?

20:18.510 --> 20:19.910
With all due respect,

20:20.290 --> 20:24.120
I believe that this matter should 
be left to Premier Sorii.

20:24.120 --> 20:25.320
What was that?!

20:25.650 --> 20:29.660
Waiting around too long will 
expose the kingdom to danger.

20:29.660 --> 20:32.830
There are rumors that neighboring 
countries will be coming after us.

20:34.100 --> 20:37.890
King Daida, please allow the Big Four
 to handle the renovation.

20:38.630 --> 20:41.560
I already have plans for 
the renovation made up.

20:41.560 --> 20:44.500
All right, I'll take care 
of managing the manpower.

20:44.870 --> 20:46.930
Let me take care of lining up materials.

20:47.330 --> 20:50.130
Then I'll oversee the funding.

20:50.440 --> 20:53.660
They all have a great deal of pride,

20:54.110 --> 20:57.630
but they did all come 
together to fight Ouken.

20:58.730 --> 21:02.430
<i>That's it! The thing that 
brings them together...</i>

21:07.240 --> 21:08.950
<i>is when a crisis...</i>

21:09.740 --> 21:11.930
<i>threatens the kingdom.</i>

21:20.420 --> 21:32.430
<i>Your precious words are now 
fluttering through the sky</i>

21:35.730 --> 21:41.440
<i>The nights when I was alone 
still had countless stars</i>

21:41.440 --> 21:46.570
<i>Even now, they're close at 
hand whenever I close my eyes</i>

21:47.070 --> 21:50.080
<i>With no destination, I kept on walking</i>

21:50.080 --> 21:52.910
<i>Although I was tired, I kept on walking</i>

21:52.910 --> 21:58.580
<i>I just wanted to remain in prayers forever</i>

21:58.580 --> 22:01.500
<i>Covered in scars, covered in mud</i>

22:01.500 --> 22:04.300
<i>stretching out hands that won't reach</i>

22:04.300 --> 22:14.100
<i>I want to seize a fragment of my 
hopes and dreams right this minute</i>

22:14.520 --> 22:20.270
<i>Keep smiling, keep smiling, 
you don't have to be strong</i>

22:20.270 --> 22:27.700
<i>That sweet smile, that 
sweet smile is all you need</i>

22:27.700 --> 22:32.280
<i>Your unique smile brings 
the power and strength</i>

22:32.280 --> 22:38.750
<i>to chase away all the clouds</i>

22:38.750 --> 22:49.090
<i>Your precious words are now 
fluttering through the sky</i>
